{
    "title": "WeMuslim: Athan, Qibla&Quran",
    "description": "WeMuslim is a user-friendly app with delicate and simple interfere and is the favorite of over 20 million Muslims. This app is the perfect companion for Muslims looking to stay on top of their religious obligations anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Prayer times - Based on your current location, this app provides accurate prayer times and plays the magnificent audio of the Athan before each prayer.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Quran Kareem - Supports audio recitations from various famous reciters and translations in nearly 10 languages and helps you do the Khatam Quran.\r\n\r\n\u262a\ufe0f Ummah - You can browse and post your thoughts on reciting the Quran, receive blessings from other Muslims, and raise your questions to be answered by the imam.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udded Qibla - This feature provides an easy-to-use compass that points in the direction of the Kaaba.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Hijri - This feature allows you to look up the Islamic calendar for future prayer times and also provides a function to record your daily prayers.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd32 Azkar - This feature includes Dua and remembrance based on Hadiths and the Quran, which can be easily read and recited.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcff Tasbih - This feature includes an electronic tasbih and prayer beads counter to assist you in keeping count while reading your prayer or Dua.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b Hajj&Umrah - This feature provides the guide for the journey of Hajj, including the explanations and instructions for the ritual.\r\n\r\n*Data charges may apply. Contact your provider for details.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nIf you have any feedback, questions, or concerns, please email us at:\r\nsupport@wemuslim.com\r\n\r\nLearn more about WeMuslim at:\r\nhttps://www.wemuslim.com\r\n---------------------------------------------------------",
    "descriptionHTML": "WeMuslim is a user-friendly app with delicate and simple interfere and is the favorite of over 20 million Muslims. This app is the perfect companion for Muslims looking to stay on top of their religious obligations anytime, anywhere.<br><br>\ud83d\udd4c Prayer times - Based on your current location, this app provides accurate prayer times and plays the magnificent audio of the Athan before each prayer.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd6 Quran Kareem - Supports audio recitations from various famous reciters and translations in nearly 10 languages and helps you do the Khatam Quran.<br><br>\u262a\ufe0f Ummah - You can browse and post your thoughts on reciting the Quran, receive blessings from other Muslims, and raise your questions to be answered by the imam.<br><br>\ud83e\udded Qibla - This feature provides an easy-to-use compass that points in the direction of the Kaaba.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 Hijri - This feature allows you to look up the Islamic calendar for future prayer times and also provides a function to record your daily prayers.<br><br>\ud83e\udd32 Azkar - This feature includes Dua and remembrance based on Hadiths and the Quran, which can be easily read and recited.<br><br>\ud83d\udcff Tasbih - This feature includes an electronic tasbih and prayer beads counter to assist you in keeping count while reading your prayer or Dua.<br><br>\ud83d\udd4b Hajj&amp;Umrah - This feature provides the guide for the journey of Hajj, including the explanations and instructions for the ritual.<br><br>*Data charges may apply. Contact your provider for details.<br><br>---------------------------------------------------------<br><br>If you have any feedback, questions, or concerns, please email us at:<br>support@wemuslim.com<br><br>Learn more about WeMuslim at:<br>https://www.wemuslim.com<br>---------------------------------------------------------",
